    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The \"cultural considerations\" part is a bit vague for my report. Some people in our office feel like it's just a way to force a certain ideology on everyone and that it makes people feel uncomfortable or like they can't speak naturally. How would you respond to the argument that prioritizing these pronouns actually hurts productivity because it creates unnecessary friction and confusion?",
